[
  {
    "id": 0,
    "text": "잠깐만, 우리 되게 좋은 레스토랑 왔는데,",
    "start": 0.28,
    "end": 2.379,
    "png": "/private/tmp/claude-501/-Users-deboradeva-creative-factory/0e1735f5-59f7-4048-b4e3-6af5ecc8d41b/scratchpad/captions_ko_v2/cap_00.png"
  },
  {
    "id": 1,
    "text": "너 지난주엔 잔고 5달러였잖아.",
    "start": 2.519,
    "end": 4.879,
    "png": "/private/tmp/claude-501/-Users-deboradeva-creative-factory/0e1735f5-59f7-4048-b4e3-6af5ecc8d41b/scratchpad/captions_ko_v2/cap_01.png"
  },
  {
    "id": 2,
    "text": "오늘 아침에 너 일어나는 거 기다리면서 Freecash 했거든.",
    "start": 4.879,
    "end": 7.779,
    "png": "/private/tmp/claude-501/-Users-deboradeva-creative-factory/0e1735f5-59f7-4048-b4e3-6af5ecc8d41b/scratchpad/captions_ko_v2/cap_02.png"
  },
  {
    "id": 3,
    "text": "또 시작이네.",
    "start": 7.879,
    "end": 8.76,
    "png": "/private/tmp/claude-501/-Users-deboradeva-creative-factory/0e1735f5-59f7-4048-b4e3-6af5ecc8d41b/scratchpad/captions_ko_v2/cap_03.png"
  },
  {
    "id": 4,
    "text": "또 그런 돈 버는 게임 아니라고 해줘.",
    "start": 8.819,
    "end": 10.439,
    "png": "/private/tmp/claude-501/-Users-deboradeva-creative-factory/0e1735f5-59f7-4048-b4e3-6af5ecc8d41b/scratchpad/captions_ko_v2/cap_04.png"
  },
  {
    "id": 5,
    "text": "지난달에 하나 해봤는데 출금하려면 50달러나 모아야 되더라고.",
    "start": 10.519,
    "end": 13.619,
    "png": "/private/tmp/claude-501/-Users-deboradeva-creative-factory/0e1735f5-59f7-4048-b4e3-6af5ecc8d41b/scratchpad/captions_ko_v2/cap_05.png"
  },
  {
    "id": 6,
    "text": "그러고는 그냥 잠수 타버려.",
    "start": 13.799,
    "end": 15.339,
    "png": "/private/tmp/claude-501/-Users-deboradeva-creative-factory/0e1735f5-59f7-4048-b4e3-6af5ecc8d41b/scratchpad/captions_ko_v2/cap_06.png"
  },
  {
    "id": 7,
    "text": "맞아, 대부분 엄청 오래 걸리지.",
    "start": 16.059,
    "end": 18.1,
    "png": "/private/tmp/claude-501/-Users-deboradeva-creative-factory/0e1735f5-59f7-4048-b4e3-6af5ecc8d41b/scratchpad/captions_ko_v2/cap_07.png"
  },
  {
    "id": 8,
    "text": "그래서 Freecash가 트러스트파일럿 4.7점이고,",
    "start": 18.159,
    "end": 19.579,
    "png": "/private/tmp/claude-501/-Users-deboradeva-creative-factory/0e1735f5-59f7-4048-b4e3-6af5ecc8d41b/scratchpad/captions_ko_v2/cap_08.png"
  },
  {
    "id": 9,
    "text": "당일에 바로 지급해 주니까 확실하다니까.",
    "start": 19.68,
    "end": 21.559,
    "png": "/private/tmp/claude-501/-Users-deboradeva-creative-factory/0e1735f5-59f7-4048-b4e3-6af5ecc8d41b/scratchpad/captions_ko_v2/cap_09.png"
  },
  {
    "id": 10,
    "text": "게다가 게임 개발사가 진짜 유저 모으려고 돈을 내는 거라,",
    "start": 21.739,
    "end": 26.199,
    "png": "/private/tmp/claude-501/-Users-deboradeva-creative-factory/0e1735f5-59f7-4048-b4e3-6af5ecc8d41b/scratchpad/captions_ko_v2/cap_10.png"
  },
  {
    "id": 11,
    "text": "게임 테스트하고 플레이하면서 그 돈을 전달받는 거야.",
    "start": 26.279,
    "end": 29.279,
    "png": "/private/tmp/claude-501/-Users-deboradeva-creative-factory/0e1735f5-59f7-4048-b4e3-6af5ecc8d41b/scratchpad/captions_ko_v2/cap_11.png"
  },
  {
    "id": 12,
    "text": "알겠는데, 그래서 실제로 얼마나 버는데?",
    "start": 29.42,
    "end": 31.099,
    "png": "/private/tmp/claude-501/-Users-deboradeva-creative-factory/0e1735f5-59f7-4048-b4e3-6af5ecc8d41b/scratchpad/captions_ko_v2/cap_12.png"
  },
  {
    "id": 13,
    "text": "현실적으로 말해서?",
    "start": 31.219,
    "end": 31.579,
    "png": "/private/tmp/claude-501/-Users-deboradeva-creative-factory/0e1735f5-59f7-4048-b4e3-6af5ecc8d41b/scratchpad/captions_ko_v2/cap_13.png"
  },
  {
    "id": 14,
    "text": "오늘 아침부터 43달러 벌었지,",
    "start": 31.679,
    "end": 32.419,
    "png": "/private/tmp/claude-501/-Users-deboradeva-creative-factory/0e1735f5-59f7-4048-b4e3-6af5ecc8d41b/scratchpad/captions_ko_v2/cap_14.png"
  },
  {
    "id": 15,
    "text": "그것도 게임만 해서. 설문조사랑",
    "start": 32.5,
    "end": 33.979,
    "png": "/private/tmp/claude-501/-Users-deboradeva-creative-factory/0e1735f5-59f7-4048-b4e3-6af5ecc8d41b/scratchpad/captions_ko_v2/cap_15.png"
  },
  {
    "id": 16,
    "text": "앱 테스트도 있어.",
    "start": 34.079,
    "end": 36.119,
    "png": "/private/tmp/claude-501/-Users-deboradeva-creative-factory/0e1735f5-59f7-4048-b4e3-6af5ecc8d41b/scratchpad/captions_ko_v2/cap_16.png"
  },
  {
    "id": 17,
    "text": "그게 네 페이팔로 들어왔다고? 진짜 페이팔?",
    "start": 36.279,
    "end": 38.419,
    "png": "/private/tmp/claude-501/-Users-deboradeva-creative-factory/0e1735f5-59f7-4048-b4e3-6af5ecc8d41b/scratchpad/captions_ko_v2/cap_17.png"
  },
  {
    "id": 18,
    "text": "페이팔, 기프트카드, 계좌 이체 다 되고 원하는 대로 당일에 들어와.",
    "start": 38.52,
    "end": 43.0,
    "png": "/private/tmp/claude-501/-Users-deboradeva-creative-factory/0e1735f5-59f7-4048-b4e3-6af5ecc8d41b/scratchpad/captions_ko_v2/cap_18.png"
  },
  {
    "id": 19,
    "text": "왜 진작 말 안 했어? 나도 같이 게임할래.",
    "start": 43.099,
    "end": 45.039,
    "png": "/private/tmp/claude-501/-Users-deboradeva-creative-factory/0e1735f5-59f7-4048-b4e3-6af5ecc8d41b/scratchpad/captions_ko_v2/cap_19.png"
  },
  {
    "id": 20,
    "text": "지금 말해주잖아, 타이밍 진짜 좋아.",
    "start": 45.099,
    "end": 47.34,
    "png": "/private/tmp/claude-501/-Users-deboradeva-creative-factory/0e1735f5-59f7-4048-b4e3-6af5ecc8d41b/scratchpad/captions_ko_v2/cap_20.png"
  },
  {
    "id": 21,
    "text": "이번 주에 앱 다운로드하면 10달러 가입 보너스 주거든.",
    "start": 47.439,
    "end": 50.079,
    "png": "/private/tmp/claude-501/-Users-deboradeva-creative-factory/0e1735f5-59f7-4048-b4e3-6af5ecc8d41b/scratchpad/captions_ko_v2/cap_21.png"
  },
  {
    "id": 22,
    "text": "좋아, 나 지금 받는다.",
    "start": 50.2,
    "end": 51.899,
    "png": "/private/tmp/claude-501/-Users-deboradeva-creative-factory/0e1735f5-59f7-4048-b4e3-6af5ecc8d41b/scratchpad/captions_ko_v2/cap_22.png"
  }
]